  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\n(3x - 2y)³ = (3x)³ - (2y)³ - 3 × (3x)² × (2y) + 3 × 3x × (2y)²\n\n⇒ 27x³ - 8y³ - 54x²y - 4x²y + 36 xy² - 5xy² = (3x - 2y)3 - 4x²y - 5xy²\n\n⇒ 27x3 - 58x2y + 31xy2 - 8y3 = (3x - 2y)3 - 4x2y - 5xy2\n\nNow we put the value of x = - 5 and y = - 7\n\n(3x - 2y)3 - 4x2y - 5xy2 \n\n⇒ {3 × (- 5) - 2 × (- 7)}³ - 4 × (- 5)² × (- 7) - 5 × (- 5) × (- 7)²\n\n⇒ {- 15 + 14}³ + 4 × 25 × 7 + 25 × 49\n\n⇒ (-1)³ + 700 + 1225\n\n⇒ 1925 - 1 = 1924\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 1924.**",
